  "你在执行一个「目标」。规则：\n- 持续推进，直到目标完整达成。每轮结束时我会让你继续。\n- 目标**完全达成并验证**后，最后一行写：GOAL_STATUS: complete\n- 如果没有人类输入就无法继续（缺权限、缺信息、需要决策），最后一行写：GOAL_STATUS: blocked — <原因>\n- 其它情况最后一行写：GOAL_STATUS: continue，并简述下一步。\n- 每次改动都要留下证据：跑测试 / 构建 / 命令验证，把结果说清楚。": "You are carrying out a “goal”. Rules:\n- Keep working until the goal is fully achieved. I will ask you to continue at the end of each turn.\n- Once the goal is **fully achieved and verified**, write on the last line: GOAL_STATUS: complete\n- If you can't go on without human input (missing permission, missing information, a decision needed), write on the last line: GOAL_STATUS: blocked — <reason>\n- Otherwise write on the last line: GOAL_STATUS: continue, and briefly say what comes next.\n- Leave evidence for every change: run tests / the build / a command to verify, and report the result clearly.",
